        <h1>Gamma-Tocotrienol as a Countermeasure against High-Energy Charged Particle-Induced Carcinogenesis, Cardiovascular Disease, and Central Nervous System Effects</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: 80NSSC19K0437</div>
